1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,310
Quitting feels like failure.\NYour ego prefers losing more\Nto admitting it lost.

2
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:14,572
This one hit close to home. I\Nonce spent two years building\Nsomething nobody wanted.

3
00:00:14,572 --> 00:00:22,794
Casinos run on this. Every\Ngambler thinks: I cannot leave\Nnow, I have already lost so

4
00:00:22,794 --> 00:00:30,512
Would you still choose this\Nstarting fresh? If not, the\Npast is an excuse.

5
00:00:30,512 --> 00:00:36,980
The past is a sunk cost. The\Nfuture is still negotiable.

